      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "© 2011 Blackwell Publishing Ltd.",
        "AbstractText": "A SNP (rs2228137) (R62W) in FCER2 has been linked with severe exacerbations in asthmatics. Transfectants expressing the SNP exhibited increased IL-4Rα expression after stimulation through CD23 compared with wild-type. Our data suggest that the SNP may favour increased IgE production through increased responsiveness to IL-4 in patients possessing this genotype."
      },
